          "meta": "2026 · Hybrid",
          "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487754180451-c456f719a1fc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=82",
          "alt": "Vehicle"
        },
        {
          "title": "Adventure AWD",
